{"Auto: 60 fps where your device keeps up, 30 where it doesn't (the game's clock stays right either way). 30 fps: steady and cooler - the phone heats less. 60 fps: always aims for 60 (game version 1.8.2; 1.0.0 and 1.6.0 run at 30).",
